  "engine_findings": [
    "runScript is absent from the server REPL, so a script cannot be invoked by name.",
    "The server answers success even for a compile error and returns the diagnostic in its body, so an HTTP status is worthless as an error signal and the receipt file is the only proof.",
    "A shipped @main script cannot be nested inside a block expression; definitions must go to the top level unwrapped, with or without the annotation.",
    "The Joern REPL shadows Console with io.joern.console.Console, which has no withOut, so output capture must fully qualify scala.Console.withOut."
  ],
  "limits": [
    "Census script on one JavaScript graph. Taint, dominance and configuration equivalence is task 11.2.",
